{
  "action": "After a standard system update you need to restart aodh and watcher to make\nall the necessary changes.",
  "cves": [
    "CVE-2026-76878"
  ],
  "description": "Chen YuXiang discovered that OpenStack Aodh did not correctly enforce\nproject scoping in its alarm list API and that the OpenStack Watcher\nwebhook trigger endpoint did not apply authorization. An attacker could\npossibly use this issue to access sensitive alarm metadata or trigger\nunauthorized action plans.",
  "id": "USN-8870-1",
  "isummary": "OpenStack Aodh and Watcher could allow unintended access to network\nservices.",
